  "limitations": [
    "The Lean theorem proves totality of the exact selected Q.raw function for input limbs bounded by 2^31-2. No no-wrap premise or successful intermediate operation is assumed. It is not a whole Rust Std/Charon/Aeneas refinement, and it does not prove field-product semantics or enclosing EbyK/EbyE/Weights::pair correctness. The frozen Rust fast_pairing.rs file is pinned but no full-body source-to-Lean byte correspondence is claimed by this packet.",
    "Prior V5/V7 coordinate artifacts are excluded; their successful receipts/source identities could not be matched. Repaired V16 coordinate source is the selected dependency.",
    "Some transitive source/object owners are pinned here without historical standalone producer receipts; only the five module receipts listed above are fresh accepted target executions. PP leaf is source/object pinned but standalone producing receipt unavailable."
  ],
